\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Completeness matrix. \emph  {(a)} what is measured for each searched morphology and where: `e2e' is injection into visibilities through the unmodified pipeline, `post' injection into retained per-integration spectra after the baseline step, and `cfg' the number of window configurations the cell spans. The two campaigns measure different quantities: 1200{} injection trials (Appendix\nobreakspace  {}\ref  {app:inject}) and 3\,888{} dwell trials over 12{} real windows. \emph  {The 0 of 500 coarse-window entry is a property of the test, not of the pipeline}: the recovery criterion requires the recovered drift to match the injected drift, which a channel wider than the whole drift track cannot satisfy. Scored on detection alone the same windows recover essentially everything (\S  \ref  {sec:dwell}).}}{12}{table.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:dwell}{{4}{12}{Completeness matrix. \emph {(a)} what is measured for each searched morphology and where: `e2e' is injection into visibilities through the unmodified pipeline, `post' injection into retained per-integration spectra after the baseline step, and `cfg' the number of window configurations the cell spans. The two campaigns measure different quantities: \NTrials {} injection trials (Appendix~\ref {app:inject}) and \NDwellTrials {} dwell trials over \NDwellWin {} real windows. \emph {The 0 of 500 coarse-window entry is a property of the test, not of the pipeline}: the recovery criterion requires the recovered drift to match the injected drift, which a channel wider than the whole drift track cannot satisfy. Scored on detection alone the same windows recover essentially everything (\S \ref {sec:dwell})}{table.4}{}}
\newlabel{tab:classcomp}{{4}{12}{Completeness matrix. \emph {(a)} what is measured for each searched morphology and where: `e2e' is injection into visibilities through the unmodified pipeline, `post' injection into retained per-integration spectra after the baseline step, and `cfg' the number of window configurations the cell spans. The two campaigns measure different quantities: \NTrials {} injection trials (Appendix~\ref {app:inject}) and \NDwellTrials {} dwell trials over \NDwellWin {} real windows. \emph {The 0 of 500 coarse-window entry is a property of the test, not of the pipeline}: the recovery criterion requires the recovered drift to match the injected drift, which a channel wider than the whole drift track cannot satisfy. Scored on detection alone the same windows recover essentially everything (\S \ref {sec:dwell})}{table.4}{}}
\newlabel{tab:compcurve}{{4}{12}{Completeness matrix. \emph {(a)} what is measured for each searched morphology and where: `e2e' is injection into visibilities through the unmodified pipeline, `post' injection into retained per-integration spectra after the baseline step, and `cfg' the number of window configurations the cell spans. The two campaigns measure different quantities: \NTrials {} injection trials (Appendix~\ref {app:inject}) and \NDwellTrials {} dwell trials over \NDwellWin {} real windows. \emph {The 0 of 500 coarse-window entry is a property of the test, not of the pipeline}: the recovery criterion requires the recovered drift to match the injected drift, which a channel wider than the whole drift track cannot satisfy. Scored on detection alone the same windows recover essentially everything (\S \ref {sec:dwell})}{table.4}{}}
