\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {25}{\ignorespaces The external calibration sample as searched at 2026 September 17. \emph  {(a)} what the frozen pipeline returned on 1322{} windows it had never seen. \emph  {(b)} the 4{} unattributed outliers, all of them from the survey sample --- an earlier version of this table assigned three of them to the calibration sample, which \texttt  {holdout\_assignment\_v381.json} contradicts --- each a single cell a few per cent above the largest of 512{} controls, and none recurring at its own tuning in a further block. The repeat row gives the largest statistic the further block returns anywhere on its own grid; the \emph  {pinned} value at the first block's own frequency and drift, which is the stronger test, is 3.60{} for CP$-$72\nobreakspace  {}2713 (\S  \ref  {sec:cp72}).}}{43}{table.25}\protected@file@percent }
